        "result_schema_ref": "#/$defs/SeedMemberAssignmentReceipt",
        "volatility": "VOLATILE",
        "transaction_semantics": "For the exact existing ProjectMember, always set assigned_at to the requested value and updated_at=now() using normal UPDATE row-lock waiting. The caller invokes this function only when its original ORM history marked assigned_at dirty, so a stale cached value still preserves the original write even if the stored value has since become equal. A missing row returns found=false with both timestamps null. NULL arguments raise 22023. No upsert, authorization, role/version/weekly_target changes, retry, or independent transaction is added; the caller owns commit or rollback and ordinary database errors propagate."
